Z||000000||JBGehling||03-11-2001||06:55 PM||||I just got it back on Friday, I gave it a bath on Saturday and drove it nearly ALL day today  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. Too much fun! <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GTNew.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GTNew2.jpg"> <BR>How can ANYONE argue the notchback looks better than this?!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GTNew3.jpg"> <P>The paint on the car looks fantastic!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GTNew4.jpg"> <P>This photo is sort of crappy, but if you look closely you can see my new Fiero GT decal and CD player...<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GTNew5.jpg"> <P>Josh<P>IMO, The 88 Fiero's are just so much more fun &lt;stock&gt; than all the other years!<BR>||||reg||1
